(7700105, 1263927, 83313, '<td valign="top">Younglings from tribe of Grog go to mewseeum to see famus cave pantings. This one is uv Kiruta, famus grate grate grate grand female of Grog. Kiruta helped hunting partee by lying on cowch in forist, distrakting animuls while hunting partee sneeked up. Can see lyon in this pickture is very confused. Grog is shure tribe ate well that nite.</td>', 'Younglings from tribe of Grog go to mewseeum to see famus cave pantings. This one is uv Kiruta, famus grate grate grate grand female of Grog. Kiruta helped hunting partee by lying on cowch in forist, distrakting animuls while hunting partee sneeked up. Can see lyon in this pickture is very confused. Grog is shure tribe ate well that nite.', '2021-09-01 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700140, 1263957, 67258, '<td valign="top">Burrowing owls are so comical - I always like seeing photos of them.  This pair are well photographed on a technical level, although I would perhaps appreciate a little more environmental context.</td>', 'Burrowing owls are so comical - I always like seeing photos of them.  This pair are well photographed on a technical level, although I would perhaps appreciate a little more environmental context.', '2021-09-02 02:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700142, 1263586, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, very nicely done.</td>', 'Oh, very nicely done.', '2021-09-02 02:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700143, 1263823, 67258, '<td valign="top">Aww.  The meadow is integral to the appeal of this photo and you have included just enough to provide the needed environmental context.</td>', 'Aww.  The meadow is integral to the appeal of this photo and you have included just enough to provide the needed environmental context.', '2021-09-02 02:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700144, 1263944, 67258, '<td valign="top">A well composed scene.  My only quibble is that you appear to have globally bumped up the saturation of the reds, which has had a slightly odd effect on the cow and, to a lesser extent, on the grass.  If Im wrong, and you havent, it might be worth playing around to reduce the reds slightly, either by reducing saturation, or increasing the red luminance.</td>', 'A well composed scene.  My only quibble is that you appear to have globally bumped up the saturation of the reds, which has had a slightly odd effect on the cow and, to a lesser extent, on the grass.  If Im wrong, and you havent, it might be worth playing around to reduce the reds slightly, either by reducing saturation, or increasing the red luminance.', '2021-09-02 02:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700145, 1263929, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully delicate.</td>', 'Beautifully delicate.', '2021-09-02 02:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700146, 1263563, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had a very close encounter with this bear!.  The sawn branch, together with your title, suggests this was in your garden - wow!!  Very well taken photo, considering how excited you must have been.</td>', 'Looks like you had a very close encounter with this bear!.  The sawn branch, together with your title, suggests this was in your garden - wow!!  Very well taken photo, considering how excited you must have been.', '2021-09-02 02:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700147, 1263925, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasingly understated study.</td>', 'A pleasingly understated study.', '2021-09-02 02:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700148, 1263840, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, nature provided excellent placement for you!  Good choice on colour shifting the sky as a nod to the flamingos.</td>', 'Ha, nature provided excellent placement for you!  Good choice on colour shifting the sky as a nod to the flamingos.', '2021-09-02 02:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700255, 1263829, 67258, '<td valign="top">Youve broadly done a good job here, but I do find the vases floating in the black background a little disconcerting.</td>', 'Youve broadly done a good job here, but I do find the vases floating in the black background a little disconcerting.', '2021-09-03 05:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700256, 1263826, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely peaceful image in the old school tradition of landscape photography.</td>', 'Lovely peaceful image in the old school tradition of landscape photography.', '2021-09-03 05:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700257, 1263272, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2021-09-03 05:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700259, 1263927, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2021-09-03 05:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700260, 1263911, 67258, '<td valign="top">It took me a short while to get my head around this - the tree branches hanging behind the water confused me until I realised it is a dam or a raised wall of a pond!  Pleasing colours, although a little more depth of field would bring the photo up a notch for me.</td>', 'It took me a short while to get my head around this - the tree branches hanging behind the water confused me until I realised it is a dam or a raised wall of a pond!  Pleasing colours, although a little more depth of field would bring the photo up a notch for me.', '2021-09-03 06:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700261, 1263960, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good reportage photo of our current times.</td>', 'A good reportage photo of our current times.', '2021-09-03 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700262, 1263947, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah, a steady hand here!  Perfectly timed - an impressive macro.</td>', 'Woah, a steady hand here!  Perfectly timed - an impressive macro.', '2021-09-03 06:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700264, 1263609, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, I particularly like the environmental context that your composition provides.</td>', 'Lovely image, I particularly like the environmental context that your composition provides.', '2021-09-03 06:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700265, 1263939, 67258, '<td valign="top">We call this Rape Seed, and in mid summer many of our fields were bright yellow pieces of a patchwork.  Now, though, it has gone out of favour due to some disease that can no longer be treated as the chemical is on the UKs banned list.  This is a lovely view, well photographed.</td>', 'We call this Rape Seed, and in mid summer many of our fields were bright yellow pieces of a patchwork.  Now, though, it has gone out of favour due to some disease that can no longer be treated as the chemical is on the UKs banned list.  This is a lovely view, well photographed.', '2021-09-03 06:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700266, 1263907, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Personal preference for just a tad more contrast and some deeper blacks, but nonetheless I really like this.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Personal preference for just a tad more contrast and some deeper blacks, but nonetheless I really like this.', '2021-09-03 06:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700267, 1263948, 67258, '<td valign="top">How cute - and my brother had a T-shirt just like that, some 50 years ago!  I like the juxtaposition of old and new.</td>', 'How cute - and my brother had a T-shirt just like that, some 50 years ago!  I like the juxtaposition of old and new.', '2021-09-03 06:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700269, 1263838, 67258, '<td valign="top">This almost looks computer generated - not a criticism, just an observation.  Your model has near perfect symmetry in her features, and the most penetrating gaze.  Really interesting lighting and post-processing, Id be curious to know your steps.</td>', 'This almost looks computer generated - not a criticism, just an observation.  Your model has near perfect symmetry in her features, and the most penetrating gaze.  Really interesting lighting and post-processing, Id be curious to know your steps.', '2021-09-03 06:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700270, 1263760, 67258, '<td valign="top">Fascinating!</td>', 'Fascinating!', '2021-09-03 06:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700272, 1263257, 67258, '<td valign="top">The classic pose, but you have done it very well.  The real connection between father and newborn is totally apparent, along with tenderness, but also something else - I cant quite place it, pain, fear, apprehension, maybe - in any event, a degree of intimacy and intensity that is missed from many other photos of this ilk.</td>', 'The classic pose, but you have done it very well.  The real connection between father and newborn is totally apparent, along with tenderness, but also something else - I cant quite place it, pain, fear, apprehension, maybe - in any event, a degree of intimacy and intensity that is missed from many other photos of this ilk.', '2021-09-03 06:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700273, 1263890, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully serene image.</td>', 'Beautifully serene image.', '2021-09-03 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
