(7700788, 1263444, 67145, '<td valign="top">been waiting till i could see this on my computer before commenting .. felt i wouldnt be doing it justice on my phone ..<br/>and i was totally right .. the details ... that tac sharp eye .. the little tongue poking out . <br/>this is an amazing capture .. and amazing viewed large .. <br/>what i do love most are those little curled over legs .. extremely cute . <br/>many congrats on the ribbon .. :)<br/> <br/>ps.. would love to know the shutter speed etc etc that you''d be using to get a photo like this .. we dont have hummingbirds where i live .. but from what i do know . they are very small . and move very very fast .. :)<br/> <br/>oh .. just scrolled down to post and noticed Lev''s comment .. lol .. ;)<br/></td>', 'been waiting till i could see this on my computer before commenting .. felt i wouldnt be doing it justice on my phone ..and i was totally right .. the details ... that tac sharp eye .. the little tongue poking out . this is an amazing capture .. and amazing viewed large .. what i do love most are those little curled over legs .. extremely cute . many congrats on the ribbon .. :) ps.. would love to know the shutter speed etc etc that you''d be using to get a photo like this .. we dont have hummingbirds where i live .. but from what i do know . they are very small . and move very very fast .. :) oh .. just scrolled down to post and noticed Lev''s comment .. lol .. ;)', '2021-09-09 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
